    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class to iterate through stack ids in both metadata (memprof MIB and callsite) and the corresponding ThinLTO summary data structures (<ref refid="structllvm_1_1_callsite_info" kindref="compound">CallsiteInfo</ref> and <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_m_i_b_info" kindref="compound">MIBInfo</ref>). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This simplifies implementation of client code which doesn&apos;t need to worry about whether we are operating with IR (Regular LTO), or summary (ThinLTO). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
